Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Tue Oct 1 13:54:30 2024 +0300

    Bug 1918885 - Fix regressions in the mailTabs and messageDisplay API related to the selection of threads and context-clicks in the thread pane. r=mkmelin


    If a collapsed thread is selected, then `mailTabs.getSelectedMessages()`
    used to return all messages, including those of the collapsed thread.
    This is no longer the case in Thunderbird 128. The original behavior
    is restored by this patch.

    A related but very old regression fixed by this patch is the behavior of
    `messageDisplay.getDisplayedMessages()` when there is a message being
    context-clicked. Instead of returning the actual displayed message, it
    returned the message currently being context-clicked. The expected
    behavior to always return the displayed message is restored by this
    patch.

    This patch adds a test to ensure the expected behavior.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D223739

